<title>USA: Intrenet Inc Q3 shr loss after charges.</title>
<headline>Intrenet Inc Q3 shr loss after charges.</headline>
<dateline>MILFORD, Ohio 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.07   profit	 $0.02</p>
<p> Net loss		     890   profit	   238</p>
<p> Revs			57,800		   53,100</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.16   profit	 $0.09</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,200   profit	 1,200</p>
<p> Revs		     168,100		  162,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q3 1996 includes charges of about $1.2 million related to severance arrangements, the write-off of certain computer equipment, the settlement and legal costs, unfavorable developments in several workers' compensation and vehicle accident claim reserves, and other unspecified charges.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
